  "order": 1,
  "culturalNote": "Ordering a ride and chatting with the driver is one of the most common everyday exchanges a visitor to Nairobi will have. The passenger (mteja) usually opens with a casual greeting, and the driver (dereva) confirms the destination before setting off. This lesson has you play the mteja — pick what you'd say, then see how the dereva responds.",
  "startingPoint": "The customer (mteja) gets in the car and starts the conversation.",
