      "english": "What's up, boss?",
      "words": [
        { "text": "Niaje", "gloss": "From \"ni aje?\" (\"how is it?\"), said fast with the stress on the first syllable. The common, casual way to say \"how are you?\"" },
        { "text": "boss", "gloss": "An English loanword used as a friendly, informal form of address — like calling someone \"boss\" or \"chief\"." }
      ],
